  "notes": "AC 7.450-1 is the former Demag-designed 7-axle crane. Datasheet has 15 main-boom lengths (14.8, 19.8, 24.8, 29.8, 34.8, 39.8, 44.8, 49.8, 54.8, 59.8, 64.8, 69.8, 74.8, 77.7, 80.0 m); 12 stored. Omitted columns (t@radius m): 39.8 m: 124.5@6, 121@7, 116.5@8, 109.5@9, 101.5@10, 86@12, 74.2@14, 64.8@16, 57.3@18, 51.5@20, 47.7@22, 43.6@24, 39.8@26, 36.1@28, 32.9@30, 30.1@32, 27.2@34, 22.2@36, 11.6@38; 59.8 m: 50.1@12, 46.3@14, 42.4@16, 38.7@18, 35.4@20, 32.5@22, 30@24, 27.8@26, 25.6@28, 23.6@30, 22@32, 20.6@34, 19.4@36, 18.3@38, 17.2@40, 16.2@42, 15.1@44, 14.2@46, 13.2@48, 12.3@50, 11.6@52, 10.8@54; 77.7 m: 25.8@18, 24.6@20, 23.3@22, 21.7@24, 20.2@26, 19@28, 17.8@30, 16.7@32, 15.8@34, 14.9@36, 14@38, 13.2@40, 12.4@42, 11.7@44, 11@46, 10.4@48, 9.8@50, 9.3@52, 8.7@54, 8.2@56, 7.7@58, 7.3@60, 6.8@62, 6.3@64, 5.8@66, 5.4@68, 5@70, 4.5@72, 4@74. 14,8* over-rear column (excluded): 450@2.5, 195.5@3, 195.5@4, 191@5, 171.5@6, 155.5@7, 140.5@8, 126.5@9, 113.5@10, 86.1@12 (450 t at 2.5 m is over rear, 0° boom position, with additional special equipment only). 2.5 m row dropped (empty in 360° columns). Footnote 2) on page 27: the values at 3 m (14.8/19.8/24.8 m: 195.5 t) and 4 m (14.8/19.8/24.8 m: 195.5 t; 29.8 m: 184.0 t) apply with 130 t counterweight (not 150 t) - stored as printed. Alternative chart p.29 uses 6.0 m (XL) counterweight radius (slightly higher mid-radius values, with 100-140 t counterweight footnotes); p.37-39 are Superlift (SSL) charts - not used. Note 1) capacities with horizontal boom: 14.8 m 33.4, 19.8 m 24.2, 24.8 m 18.6, 29.8 m 14.5, 34.8 m 11.6, 39.8 m 9.0, 44.8 m 7.1, 49.8 m 5.1, 54.8 m 3.5, 59.8 m 1.8 t. Datasheet technical description: 6 sheaves in boom head for 134.3 t standard (higher short-radius ratings require additional equipment). Counterweight 150 t = 20 t base frame + 12 x 10 t + 2 x 5 t (or 10 x 10 t + 6 x 5 t). Weight of hook blocks and slings is part of the load and must be deducted. Dimensions p.6 (mm): overall length 17619 incl. boom, carrier 15987, boom overhang 1632; axle spacing 2537 (front to axle 1), 1650, 1650, 2655, 1650, 2200, 1650; rear overhang 1995; slewing centre 600 ahead of axle 6 (derived 11742 from carrier front). Outriggers 8250 longitudinal (4805 + 3445 / 4395 + 3855), 8452 transverse (2700/4020/5490/6982 intermediate). Width 3000 (3120 with 525/80R25; 2700 also shown). Height 3938 with standard 385/95R25 tyres (4000 with 445/95 or 525/80); 3777 also shown. Tail radius R5600 (STD) / R6040 (XL) / R6620 with CC counterweight slabs. Operating weight, max outrigger force, max hook height, boom pivot and number of boom sections not given numerically."
